license: MIT
keywords:
  - QAOA
  - quantum optimization
  - container relocation problem
  - QUBO
  - IBM Quantum
  - simulated annealing
  - MILP
abstract: >-
  Code, raw IBM hardware records and analysis for a study of fixed-angle,
  depth-2 QAOA on five small restricted Container Relocation Problem bays
  (8 instance-encoding pairings, 40 jobs, 80,000 shots on ibm_fez), compared
  with exact uniform random sampling, an exact MILP model, a greedy rule and
  simulated annealing. Code is MIT-licensed; data and documentation are
  CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE-DATA.md).
